sequenceDiagram
    %% autonumber
    actor Librarian
    participant System
    participant Database as Library Database

    Librarian->>System: Enters Customer ID and Book ID
    System->>Database: Checks Customer's standing

    alt Customer has Unpaid Fines (3a)
        Database-->>System: Reports unpaid fines
        System-->>Librarian: Shows error: Fines must be paid first
    else Customer Reached Maximum Holds (3b)
        Database-->>System: Reports maximum holds reached
        System-->>Librarian: Shows error: Hold limit reached
    else Customer Eligible
        Database-->>System: Confirms Customer is eligible
        System->>Database: Checks Book's current status

        alt Book is Actually Available (5a)
            Database-->>System: Reports Book is available
            System-->>Librarian: Shows message: Book is on the shelf
        else Book Not Eligible for Holds (5b)
            Database-->>System: Reports Book is not eligible
            System-->>Librarian: Shows error: Book cannot be placed on hold
        else Book Eligible (Checked Out)
            Database-->>System: Confirms Book is checked out and eligible
            System->>Database: Adds Customer to Book's hold queue
            System->>Database: Increments Customer's active hold count
            System-->>Librarian: Shows confirmation: Hold placed successfully
        end
    end
